Port modifications by Raymond (yippieyaray), 2026-09-28 through 2026-10-08.

Changes include the Java 25/Paper 26.2 build, neutral Java package namespace,
Bukkit permission checks for LuckPerms, inventory/crafting/hazard handling,
startup validation, configuration migration, localization, OP bypass and tests.
On 2026-09-30, comments, plugin metadata and documentation were updated,
release notes were added to the versioned source distribution, and Brazilian
Portuguese, Polish and Turkish messages and language regression tests were added.
The Maven test setup now loads Mockito as a startup Java agent without self-attachment.
A build script selects persistent user-local tools without changing system Java settings.
This is an independent fork, not an official release by the original maintainers.

