On 2026-10-01, the build script and documentation were updated to use the shared
minecraft-devtools directory and explain setup, overrides and verification.

A compact four-rank LuckPerms example and its distribution entries were added
on 2026-10-05.
On 2026-10-05, normal permission checks were updated to exclude implicit OP
grants when op-bypass is false, with regression tests and upgrade guidance.
On 2026-10-05, an administrative permission diagnostic command was added,
sharing the action permission policy and covering console and player usage.
On 2026-10-06, diagnostic command labels, colors, help and command permissions
were refined, and the diagnostic command tests were updated.
On 2026-10-06, the pinned Paper API was updated to 26.2.build.130-stable.

On 2026-10-07, permission diagnostics were localized in all seven supported
languages, with single-line validation, English fallback, and migration of
missing diagnostic keys with exact language-file backups and regression tests.
Migration handling now uses numeric release/beta comparison, ordered fixed-version
steps, version-only updates without configuration backups, and contextual INFO logs.
On 2026-10-08, release documentation and source-package contents were prepared
for the BETA.6 handoff, including migration logging instructions in AGENTS.md.
